@startuml raditrack_activity_import_examinations
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155

title RADiTrack — Activity Diagram: Importing Examinations (.xlsx / .csv)

|Administrator|
start
:Open Examinations → **Import exams**;
:Drag and drop or choose an .xlsx\n(sheet "Exams") or .csv file;

|RADiTrack|
if (File type .xlsx / .csv and ≤ 1 MB?) then (no)
  :Show the problem in the dialog;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
if (Row 1 is the column headers\n(Accession, Modality, Patient_Category)?) then (no)
  :Show "Row 1 must be the column headers";
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Validate every row\n(accession, modality, category, dates and numbers,\nExcel errors, times in order, not in the future,\nno duplicate accession in the file, ≤ 5,000 rows);
:Match radiologist names\n(capitals and spacing ignored);
:Compare each row with the stored exam\n(by accession number);
:Plan each row: **new**, **update** (not signed off),\n**unchanged**, **amendment** (signed off within\nthe amendment window) or **refused**;
:Show preview: counts, rows to fix,\nunknown radiologists, changes per exam;

|Administrator|
if (Unknown radiologist listed?) then (yes)
  :Add as new radiologist\n(or fix the spelling in the file);
  |RADiTrack|
  :Check the file again;
  |Administrator|
else (no)
endif
if (Rows with problems?) then (yes)
  :Download rejected rows (CSV),\nfix the file and upload again;
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Choose how to import;

if (Mode?) then (Add or update)
  if (Amendments listed?) then (yes)
    :Tick "Apply amendments"\nor leave them to be skipped;
  else (no)
  endif
  :Press **Import**;
  |RADiTrack|
  :In one transaction (imports run one at a time):\nadd new exams, update unsigned exams,\napply confirmed amendments (TAT stays on\nthe first sign-off), skip unchanged rows;
  :Log refused rows and skipped amendments\nwith their reason;
else (Load as test data)
  |Administrator|
  :Confirm replacing all exams;
  |RADiTrack|
  if (Real data already backed up?) then (no)
    :Back up real exams and reports;
  else (yes)
  endif
  :In one transaction: clear exams and\ninsert the file's exams;
endif
:Calculate TAT and SLA breach for\nsigned reports (current SLA targets);
:Record the upload in the upload log\nand every exam change in the audit trail;
:Refresh dashboard and other open tabs;

|Administrator|
:See "Added N, updated N, amended N,\nunchanged N, refused N" with file, time and user;
stop

note right
  An upload can later be undone from
  Configuration → Audit log → Uploads
  (see the Audit Log and Undo Upload diagram).
end note

@enduml
